title: testing: nothing to lint fails the run
file: ./test/grice/testing_test.gleam
test_name: nothing_to_lint_fails_the_run_test
---
error[grice/invalid-config]: Nothing to lint

`tools.grice.include` and `tools.grice.exclude` in `gleam.toml` select no
module, so there is nothing to lint, and grice doesn't report success over
code it didn't check.

Hint: Include at least one module under `src/`, `test/` or `dev/`, and
check that `exclude` doesn't remove them all.

grice couldn't complete the run. Fix the problems above and run it again.

